            </a>
          </li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
            <a href="https://ampp.org" style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;">
              AMPP (Formerly NACE International) – Global Corrosion Authority
            </a>
          </li>
